WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.302
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.302 --> 00:00:03.168
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.168 --> 00:00:04.237
Let's get to the news.

00:00:04.237 --> 00:00:06.272
Senate Majority Leader
Chuck Schumer

00:00:06.272 --> 00:00:08.174
spoke yesterday
on the Senate floor

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:09.876
and said that the U.S.
is getting

00:00:09.876 --> 00:00:13.079
"dangerously close
to hitting the debt ceiling,"

00:00:13.079 --> 00:00:16.482
which is scary because there has
never been a group of people

00:00:16.482 --> 00:00:20.519
less likely to spontaneously
raise the roof.

00:00:20.519 --> 00:00:22.288
President Biden had lunch today

00:00:22.288 --> 00:00:23.689
with Vice President
Kamala Harris,

00:00:23.689 --> 00:00:27.493
and even that bill
couldn't get figured out.

00:00:27.493 --> 00:00:30.730
In a new interview,
ex-U.N. ambassador Nikki Haley

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:33.666
said that she calls former
President Trump a friend,

00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:37.002
while Trump calls her Linda.

00:00:37.002 --> 00:00:40.473
The U.S. Capitol Police
yesterday forcibly removed a man

00:00:40.473 --> 00:00:43.610
from a suspicious SUV parked
outside of the Supreme Court.

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:46.212
They knew something was off
when the back window

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:48.080
didn't have this sticker on it.

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:50.784
That's right --
The Capitol Police removed a man

00:00:50.784 --> 00:00:53.720
from a suspicious SUV parked
outside of the Supreme Court.

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:56.022
The man was apparently
so suspicious,

00:00:56.022 --> 00:00:59.192
Republicans want him
on the Supreme Court.

00:00:59.192 --> 00:01:01.294
Facebook released a statement
yesterday

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:04.330
explaining the cause of Monday's
six-hour-long outage.

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.466
And, man, she is screwing
everything up lately.

00:01:07.466 --> 00:01:09.903
"I unplugged the server
so I could charge my phone.

00:01:09.903 --> 00:01:12.338
Not sorry."

00:01:12.338 --> 00:01:15.708
Singer Adele announced yesterday
she'll release a new single

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:18.043
called "Easy on Me"
later this month.

00:01:18.043 --> 00:01:20.079
Incidentally, a new single

00:01:20.079 --> 00:01:22.815
is also who's going to
listen to it the most.

00:01:22.815 --> 00:01:25.651
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.651 --> 00:01:27.520
Poor lady, take a stock photo.

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:29.322
She's like,
"This will never come up."

00:01:29.322 --> 00:01:32.324
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.324 --> 00:01:34.828
"They won't use this one."

00:01:34.828 --> 00:01:36.662
More apartments in Manhattan

00:01:36.662 --> 00:01:38.665
sold in the third quarter
of this year

00:01:38.665 --> 00:01:41.066
than any other time
in the last 32 years.

00:01:41.066 --> 00:01:43.936
So now the only affordable
neighborhood in New York

00:01:43.936 --> 00:01:46.639
is WeHu,
meaning west of the Hudson,

00:01:46.639 --> 00:01:48.708
and, yeah, sorry,
it's New Jersey.

00:01:48.708 --> 00:01:50.543
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:55.381
You have a view of Manhattan.

00:01:55.381 --> 00:01:57.383
The fast-food chain Wendy's

00:01:57.383 --> 00:01:59.818
announced a partnership
with Kellogg's yesterday

00:01:59.818 --> 00:02:02.488
to release a chocolate
Frosty-flavored cereal.

00:02:02.488 --> 00:02:06.059
Not to be outdone, McDonald's
is releasing a McFlurry cereal

00:02:06.059 --> 00:02:08.561
that is temporarily
out of service.

00:02:08.561 --> 00:02:11.297
And finally, according to
the latest rankings,

00:02:11.297 --> 00:02:13.166
former President Trump
is no longer

00:02:13.166 --> 00:02:16.702
on "Forbes" magazine's list
of the 400 richest Americans,

00:02:16.702 --> 00:02:19.305
but on the bright side,
he still made the list

00:02:19.305 --> 00:02:21.507
of the 46 greatest presidents.

00:02:21.507 --> 00:02:23.576
And that, you guys,
was the monologue.

